the rims' light. Only within about three metres, where a bead\nis more than a pixel or two (it fades out by the pixel's size on the\npane), and only in the rain (uWet).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Run checks and commit the beaded windows"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"d3cdceaa-a62e-4878-9ec7-2d6e8db5a752","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgFqrXE2s4xqNaSaJDC6t","requestRef":"82011396-046c-4623-80ad-d9a5112c1ee5","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"cff50166-fd70-4f63-97ae-02dc3298d68b","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:19:05.480Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
