_zoom.jpg', quality=92)\n\"","description":"Zoom on the soldier's upper body, off vs on"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"6383042e-de6c-49db-a501-df224c569671","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFrRtGF1oBzfJymdC97R","requestRef":"8111b0dc-3736-412b-88ae-e61a56a9ece1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"dd82c7a0-22ce-4db7-ac0b-0f4a0ebe1c8f","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:26:37.199Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
