{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"a31c95e6c6010e2325af63d54a8c7d780acf9f8c8715a8aa03bb24fe3de81023","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"At 25 the dirt just blends into the haze around the lights, and at 40 it washes out the truck entirely—so I'll revert that and check other weaker spots instead, like the forest, trenches, and bunker, which I haven't examined closely yet.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Qhy6jK64UJrmnnU2DViRAX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git checkout fun/hedgerow/js/bloom.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js && git status --short && echo reverted; grep -n \"BUNKER = \\|CLEARING = \\|TRENCH_W = \\|TRENCH_E = \\|TRENCH_C = \" fun/hedgerow/js/levels/saint-clair.js | head","description":"Revert lens dirt; find the forest landmarks"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
