{"parentUuid":"a3c5c6dd-218c-41f5-95d1-619941d99238","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFsrrzuEiARuszj2XLYR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018uK2AeyCmeLaBYs48P5gUf","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np = 'README.md'\ns = open(p).read()\nold = \"\"\"`shafts.js` while a flare burns, the lit length of\n    each view ray's first 45 m in its shadow map (beams between the roofs,\n    through the crowns), at half resolution ·\"\"\"\nif s.count(old) != 1:\n    i = s.find('`shafts.js`')\n    print(repr(s[i:i+300]))\n    raise SystemExit(1)\ns = s.replace(old, \"\"\"`shafts.js` while a flare burns, the lit length of\n    each view ray's first 45 m in its shadow map (beams between the roofs,\n    through the crowns), at half resolution; and for the lamp or fire\n    casting shadows near the camera, the share of its glow along each ray\n    that is not in shadow (twelve equiangular looks into its cube shadow\n    map), so a truck's cab or a wall cuts dark shafts out of its glow ·\"\"\")\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nEOF\ncd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/shafts.js fun/hedgerow/js/volumetric.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: firelight shafts in the rain\n\nThe glow a fire or a lamp put into the wet air (volumetric.js, the\nclosed-form airlight integral) was cut only by what each pixel shows:\nthe air itself was lit everywhere round the light, through the truck's\ncab, behind the wall a lamp hangs on. Now the light casting shadows\nnear the camera (lights.js: the strongest lamp or fire about, which has\na cube shadow map anyway) has its glow shadowed. shafts.js gains a\nsecond half-resolution pass: along the stretch of each view ray that\nvolumetric.js integrates for that light, twelve points spaced\nequiangularly about it (Kulla and Fajardo: as its inverse-square light\nfalls along the ray, so their average visibility is exactly the share\nof the closed-form integral that reaches the eye) are looked up in its\ncube shadow map as three's point shadows compare them, jittered per\npixel; volumetric.js multiplies that light's glow by the result,\nbrought up with the same depth-aware upsample. The truck's cab casts a\ndark shaft through its fire's glow, the walls of the ruin cut it, a\nwall lamp's glow no longer shows on the far side of its wall.\n\nHigh and medium quality (it rides on the flare shafts' place in the\nchain, which needs the shadows); within the noise of the measurement.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Commit the firelight shafts"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1007,"cache_read_input_tokens":922949,"output_tokens":1160,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1007,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1160,"cache_read_input_tokens":922949,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1007,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1007},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_018uK2AeyCmeLaBYs48P5gUf":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 - <<'EOF'\np = 'README.md'\ns = open(p).read()\nold = \"\"