{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","id":"e2e0041d-986d-418b-a60c-a4ffc21e7405","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:45:52.081Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"aca1d33e67df77c08846866245a8b157faabfdb8617ed3a1eb9cac3e5556c296","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"5cc776fb-63d4-487d-bad2-476611a1d6bf","keep":2077,"tail":["e064901e14e5bb6a43be3e1b1d44f4dc9ff81a24bebe33c50a2aa3c3b93e5531","e4f5bbbdc8df1538e4c4c966b60a69bcbff652548838398bbe975355b4440ed2","6d3d431998f9caf7a9033d0be5456c23fa9be1e8a7d1b700fffe94afdcd439e9"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",2079,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"36be14fd522cb594d346cfde9610ea1dbde142bca568cfef639996eed75eef5a"}
{"parentUuid":"c2ba273f-c2ac-4362-9f8f-812d21d42cd3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFsv24hQaLaSDcwCF4Ba","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"One more commit on `hedgerow-grass` this round, and one idea checked and dropped. The commit was verified in a headless browser on the real GPU. The node checks pass, low, medium and high quality all compile cleanly, it merges cleanly into `hedgerow-poc`, and nothing is pushed.\n\n- **014b48b6, firelight shafts in the rain:** the glow that fires and lamps put into the rainy air ignored shadows, so it lit the air evenly around the light, straight through the burning truck's cab. Now the light casting shadows near the camera has its glow shadowed too; that's whichever lamp or fire is strongest nearby, and it already has a shadow map. A half-resolution pass samples that shadow map along each view ray.\n  - **How visible:** at eight times the normal haze, the truck cab clearly casts a dark shaft through its fire's glow where the haze used to be uniform. At the game's normal density the effect is subtle.\n  - **Cost:** within measurement noise. It runs on high and medium only.\n  - My commit message also says a wall lamp's glow no longer shows behind its wall. That follows from how it works, but I didn't capture it specifically.\n- **Checked and dropped: rain falling under the café awning.** Standing under it, nothing visibly wrong showed, because the near rain already fades out within about 4 m and the awning edge is closer. Blocking rain under roofs would have been sizeable work for no visible gain.\n\nThe branch is now 40 commits ahead of `hedgerow-poc`, and the shared notes list them all. The test server, the headless browser and my `launch.json` entry are all removed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":241,"cache_read_input_tokens":927138,"output_to