foley: steps by what is\n    underfoot — hobnails on stone, sucking mud, swishing grass, crackling\n    leaves, hollow planks, splashing water — the kit when running and\n    landing, reloads in their parts, empty cases ringing on stone, bodies","numLines":12,"startLine":220,"totalLines":327}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e0986e8e-671e-4931-8da8-12c2d2a31561","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
