{"parentUuid":"15aae165-4e4e-401f-8fef-d8cbfa7c0af7","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01Sis5WA8rMK2WkXynZzCurU","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"cfc9e06d-fc4b-4e76-be9c-e77a8fcc2711","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:24:24.777Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"cfc9e06d-fc4b-4e76-be9c-e77a8fcc2711","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFvqzg6WDqJGjvG4R6SE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014UmGfuJiwCmYx2J62LvD34","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\np='README.md'\ns=open(p).read()\na=\"\"\"    and by flares and lightning, fading into the haze), `fireball.js` (a\"\"\"\nb=\"\"\"    and by flares and lightning, fading into the haze; drawn before the\n    light in the rain, whose glow hangs in front of it), `fireball.js` (a\"\"\"\nassert s.count(a)==1\ns=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\ncd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git add fun/hedgerow/README.md fun/hedgerow/js/plumes.js fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: no black smoke columns in the muzzle flash\n\nThe smoke plumes over the fires were drawn in the late pass, after the light\nin the rain had already added the glow of lamps, fires and muzzle flashes\nfor the whole view ray. Their alpha blend then took that glow out wherever a\nplume stood behind it: every shot lit the haze round the player and the\ndistant plumes cut black columns through it (likewise next to lamps and\nblasts). The plumes are now drawn in the chain's first pass with the\nparticles (same depth fade), so the glow in front of them is laid on top.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && git merge-tree --write-tree hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\"","description":"Commit the plume ordering fix"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":933,"cache_read_input_tokens":318478,"output_tokens":694,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_sea