{"parentUuid":"161d211e-9d80-4814-94dd-22d8e072ccf9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014exVEocWXd2jtbg2bzziK3","type":"tool_result","content":"/* Hedgerow — light.\n\n   Dusk under rain clouds: a cool hemisphere, a dim low key light from the\n   west where the last of the sun is, and fog. Local light comes from a\n   fixed pool of point lights (so shaders never recompile) that each frame\n   take the strongest \"virtual\" sources near the camera: lanterns, lit\n   windows, fires (flickering), and short flashes from muzzles and\n   explosions, which always win a slot.\n\n   One more light casts shadows: each frame it takes the strongest outdoor\n   lamp, lantern or fire near the camera (statics marked `shadow`), so the\n   houses, props and soldiers near it throw shadows that swing with a\n19:import * as THREE from 'three';\nok","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"424c033d-2442-4559-944b-cb1b35fc81a4","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:54:06.561Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"/* Hedgerow — light.\n\n   Dusk under rain clouds: a cool hemisphere, a dim low key light from the\n   west where the last of the sun is, and fog. Local light comes from a\n   fixed pool of point lights (so shaders never recompile) that each frame\n   take the strongest \"virtual\" sources near the camera: lanterns, lit\n   windows, fires (flickering), and short flashes from muzzles and\n   explosions, which always win a slot.\n\n   One more light casts shadows: each frame it takes the strongest outdoor\n   lamp, lantern or fire near the camera (statics marked `shadow`), so the\n   houses, props and soldiers near it throw shadows that swing with a\n19:import * as THREE from 'three';\nok","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/js/lights.js","hunks":[{"o