{"parentUuid":"aae5032a-0399-45cd-8991-ce13d46e77f3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFyyvY7ukUVx3zNFDDzt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YCZpLMkx2hjoL3mi3WxpKE","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","old_string":"  Observed, not fixed: the axis soldiers' upper sleeves are baked with low roughness, so they are\n  not taken for wool and look like glossy rubber when wet (uSkinDebug = 2 shows it). A colour-aware\n  cloth test or an atlas roughness fix would cure it.","new_string":"- 28915b17 FIX: the axis upper sleeves/shoulders (baked roughness 0.5-0.7) were not taken for wool\n  and went rubbery-glossy when wet. clothK now also = rough >= ~0.55 AND wool-coloured (not\n  saturated brown, not black, bind-pose y < 1.57 so the same-grey helmet stays steel).\n  uSkinDebug = 2 shows the classification (green wool, red skin)."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1838,"cache_read_input_tokens":579264,"output_tokens":565,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":149},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1838,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":565,"cache_read_input_tokens":579264,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1838,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1838},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01YCZpLMkx2hjoL3mi3WxpKE":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","old_string":"  Observed, not fixed: the axis soldiers' upper sleeves are baked with low roughness, so they are\n  not taken for wool and look like glossy rubber when wet (uSkinDebug = 2 shows it). A colour-aware\n  cloth test or an atlas roughness fix would cure it.","new_string":"- 28915b17 FIX: the axis upper sleeves/shoulders (baked roughness 0.5-0.7) were not taken for wool\n  and went rubbery-glossy when wet. clothK now also = rough >= ~0.55 AND wool-coloured (not\n  saturated brown, not black, bind-pose y < 1.57 so the same-grey helmet stays steel).\n  uSkinDebug = 2 shows the classification (green wool, red skin)."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"d32259d5-6df5-47e7-98d9-76e5fbe7da75","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFyyuvumvucenmizXXy5","requestRef":"3802991d-0e88-439c-8519-45a6889f30ea","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0831fd3e-66ad-45cb-89cc-bdb6470b36c2","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:05:32.549Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"0831fd3e-66ad-45cb-89cc-bdb6470b36c2","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"6d5c0a1d-fdd5-4db0-8cbd-a5c82a0adcb7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YCZpLMkx2hjoL3mi3WxpKE","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"70b68b2f-f445-47ab-8e57-8a1b504f494e","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:05:33.050Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","oldString":"  Observed, not fixed: the axis soldiers' upper sleeves are baked with low roughness, so they are\n  not taken for wool and look like glossy rubber when wet (uSkinDebug = 2 shows it). A colour-aware\n  cloth test or an atlas roughness fix would cure it.","newString":"- 28915b17 FIX: the axis upper sleeves/shoulders (baked roughness 0.5-0.7) were not taken for wool\n  and went rubbery-glossy when wet. clothK now also = rough >= ~0.55 AND wool-coloured (not\n  saturated brown, not black, bind-pose y < 1.57 so the same-grey helmet stays steel).\n  uSkinDebug = 2 shows the classification (green wool, red skin).","originalFile":null,"structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":150,"oldLines":9,"newStart":150,"newLines":10,"lines":[" - 00ee1ea8 close-up wool weave / skin grain on soldiers within 3 m (materials.js skin variant:","   vSkP/vSkN bind-pose varyings, textures.fabric + the grain texture, SKIN_UNIFORMS.uCloseUp,","   tFabric). Mostly for the first-person arms; subtle by design.","-  Observed, not fixed: the axis soldiers' upper sleeves are baked with low roughness, so they are","-  not taken for wool and look like glossy rubber when wet (uSkinDebug = 2 shows it). A colour-aware","-  cloth test or an atlas roughness fix would cure it.","+- 28915b17 FIX: the axis upper sleeves/shoulders (baked roughness 0.5-0.7) were not taken for wool","+  and went rubbery-glossy when wet. clothK now also = rough >= ~0.55 AND wool-coloured (not","+  saturated brown, not black, bind-pose y < 1.57 so the same-grey helmet stays steel).","+  uSkinDebug = 2 shows the classification (green wool, red skin)."," "," Measured: the meadow grass costs ~5.8-9.5 ms on this headless GPU at high quality looking across"," the meadow (0.5 ms looking at the sky), and it scales with pixels (fragment-bound: shading the"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"d32259d5-6df5-47e7-98d9-76e5fbe7da75","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0831fd3e-66ad-45cb-89cc-bdb6470b36c2","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
