{"parentUuid":"57634cfd-dfbd-4a65-88d8-0737e1bae048","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFz4r9bHv7BmSB4sfzXt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added three more commits to `hedgerow-grass` this round. Nothing is pushed, the branch still merges cleanly into `hedgerow-poc`, and the four first-person files (camera, player, hud, character) are untouched.\n\n- **8080ed1e – your own shots no longer wash out the screen.** Every shot used to fill the whole frame with a cream haze: houses 30 m away looked floodlit and the sky turned beige. A light flash now keeps only 15% of its glow in the rain when it's within 1.5 m of the camera, rising to the full glow from 4 m out. Enemy muzzle flashes and explosions are unchanged, and the warm light your flash throws on your hands, the gun and the street nearby stays.\n- **00ee1ea8 – the first-person arms look like wool and skin up close.** The soldier's one texture covers the whole body, so the sleeves were smooth and the hands looked plastic. Within 3 m the sleeves now show a fine wool weave and the hands a skin grain, and both stay put as the arms move. The effect is deliberately subtle; enemies at arm's length get it too. `SKIN_UNIFORMS.uCloseUp` in `materials.js` controls the strength.\n- **28915b17 – German uniforms stay wool across the shoulders.** On the German soldiers, about a third of the grey uniform (shoulders and upper arms) wasn't recognised as cloth, so it went shiny like rubber in the rain. Uniforms are now also recognised by colour, so the whole jacket reads as wet wool. Leather straps, belts, boots and the steel helmet keep their shine.\n\nI also looked at an explosion, a burning flare, the burning truck and enemy soldiers at 20–30 m. None needed a fix: enemies mostly sit behind cover and read as dark silhouettes against lit areas, which suits a night fight, so I didn't add an artificial outline light.\n\nAll three quality presets compile without shader errors and the node checks pass. The test server and headless browser are stopped and my `launch.json` entry is removed. Each commit is logged in the shared notes file, `hedgerow-grass-session.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":246,"cache_read_input_tokens":585539,"output_tokens":712,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":246,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":712,"cache_read_input_tokens":585539,"cache_creation_input_tokens":246,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":246},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"d61cfd6d-81a6-4a9e-a2a9-fa10421cc933","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFz4qVuE7PHCviFh1Tzv","requestRef":"dadc38ee-f5af-4780-b6af-9ff3a89e8c5d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"2a414c04-e48c-42fd-a006-e2c59eaab1b4","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:06:40.028Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"REDACTED","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
